{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124082","id":4711541582,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGNRrTg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124082","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124082.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124082.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124082","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124082/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124082/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124082/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5d44e3e34fd2fdbb77026907976b1e1317928a07","number":124082,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix window initial position enum string formatting inconsistency","user":{"login":"Meghna45-code","id":203612688,"node_id":"U_kgDODCLiEA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203612688?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code","html_url":"https://github.com/Meghna45-code","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meghna45-code/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"1. Summary:\r\nFixes an inconsistency in how enum strings are formatted for window positioning settings under Project Settings > General > Display > Window > Size and Window::initial_position.\r\n\r\n2. Problem:\r\nHovering over options under Initial Position Type (or inspecting the dropdown menu) showed options with a redundant \"Center of\" prefix (e.g., \"Center of Primary Screen\", \"Center of Other Screen\"). This created naming inconsistencies with standard property naming conventions and documentation.\r\n\r\n3. Solution:\r\n1. Removed the redundant \"Center of\" prefix from the enum hint strings in scene/main/window.cpp and core/config/project_settings.cpp.\r\n2. Formatted all enum options to match standard property naming conventions:\r\n   - Primary Screen Center\r\n   - Main Window Screen Center\r\n   - Other Screen Center\r\n   - Screen With Mouse Pointer Center\r\n   - Screen With Keyboard Focus Center\r\n3. Updated class reference documentation in doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml and code comments in main/main.cpp.\r\n\r\n4. Verification:\r\n1. Verified code style using misc/scripts/file_format.py (Passed).\r\n2. Verified XML structure using Python ElementTree (Passed).\r\n3. Verified documentation integrity with doc/tools/doc_status.py (Passed).\r\n\r\ncloses issue #120656 ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arch